From 9aba5ca404ad1457d58a3e1fb8e363a8acaa2ef0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Candice Cantrelle <glowstick.2017@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 01:04:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild as a multi-discipline portfolio

Replaces the jewellery-services site with a seven-wing portfolio built on
the Orbital design system from the Simulations atlas.

Architecture
- Static HTML/CSS/JS, no framework and no build step
- assets/css: tokens, base, shell, cards, worlds (five stylesheets)
- assets/js: shell (header/footer/theme), cards (registry rendering)
- data/projects.js: a curated allowlist. Nothing renders unless it is
  listed there, and portfolioStatus "hidden" is filtered at the query
  layer. No GitHub API calls at runtime.

Pages
- Homepage, seven wings, About, Credentials, four case studies,
  archive index, 404. Games is built but held out of the global nav
  until there is a game in it.

Accuracy corrections
- Removed unsubstantiated engagement/time-on-market figures and
  unattributed testimonials; they remain visible in the archive
- Key to STL reclassified showcase -> prototype: the bitting extraction
  is np.random.uniform and the hosted endpoint returns a placeholder
- Only verified ML metrics are published; cleared notebook outputs are
  reported as unverifiable rather than estimated
- Withdrew a third-party branded retouch pair and a self-branding sheet

Housekeeping
- Deleted CNAME so the site serves from candicecantrelle.github.io
- Old pages preserved under /archive/, noindex and unlinked
- 46.7 MB of imagery re-encoded to 3.2 MB of WebP
- WCAG AA contrast verified in both themes; keyboard, reduced-motion,
  alt text and heading order checked on every page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WSb3XsXSDxtCUgWpzkqvRm
