+  <header class="plate">
+    <div class="wrap plate__grid">
+      <div>
+        <p class="plate__kicker">Case study · AI + ML</p>
+        <h1>Facial Emotion Detection</h1>
+        <p class="plate__lede">A transfer-learning classifier for four facial expressions, reported at the accuracy it reached rather than the accuracy it was aiming for.</p>
+      </div>
+      <p class="stamp"><b>Showcase</b><br>VGG16 · TensorFlow/Keras<br>March 2025</p>
