+        <p class="plate__kicker">Case study · AI + ML</p>
+        <h1>SVHN Digit Recognition</h1>
+        <p class="plate__lede">Two dense networks and two convolutional ones on the same problem, compared on accuracy and on the thing accuracy tables usually leave out: what it took to get there.</p>
+      </div>
+      <p class="stamp"><b>Showcase</b><br>TensorFlow/Keras · CNN<br>February 2025</p>
